WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.420
Istanbul, 2015.

2
00:00:02.470 --> 00:00:06.630
Muslim scholars issue a declaration
on global climate change.

3
00:00:06.680 --> 00:00:10.420
They call on governments to phase
out greenhouse gas emissions.

4
00:00:10.470 --> 00:00:13.880
Four years later, in
Cambridge, a new mosque opens,

5
00:00:13.930 --> 00:00:15.590
built to be green.

6
00:00:15.640 --> 00:00:18.680
Islam began long before climate science.

7
00:00:18.730 --> 00:00:23.290
So can a 7th-century idea guide
Muslims through climate change?

8
00:00:23.340 --> 00:00:27.530
In this mission, you'll read what the
Qur'an and the Prophet's sayings teach about

9
00:00:27.580 --> 00:00:29.820
land, sea and animals.

10
00:00:29.870 --> 00:00:33.640
Then you'll ask whether modern
science has changed Muslim beliefs,

11
00:00:33.690 --> 00:00:35.760
or only how they are applied.

12
00:00:35.810 --> 00:00:40.440
Your mission: weigh up whether an ancient
idea can guide Muslims through climate

13
00:00:40.490 --> 00:00:41.170
change.
